'''S1D6-SA-5''' was a [[Color|red]]-colored<ref name="SoloOG" /> [[SA-5 protocol droid]]<ref name="Kids" /> that saw use in a control hub of the [[Spice mines of Kessel]]. S1D6-SA-5 and the other [[droid]]s used by the [[Pyke]]s were freed in [[10 BBY]] during an [[Raid on Kessel|slave uprising]] started by the droid [[L3-37]].<ref name="Solo">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
S1D6-SA-5 was portrayed by [[Stephanie Silva]]<ref name="Topps">{{Topps|set=2019 Topps Star Wars Masterwork|cardname=Stephanie Silva as S1D6-SA-5}}</ref> in the [[2018]] film ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''. It appeared prior to the film's release in the "[[Kessel Run]] ''[[Millennium Falcon]]''" [[LEGO]] set. The droid was identified only as "Kessel Operations Droid" by LEGO,<ref name="LEGO">{{LEGOCite|num=75212|name=Kessel Run Millennium Falcon}}</ref> but received a name in ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story The Official Guide]]'', a reference book written by [[Pablo Hidalgo]] and released alongside the film.<ref name="SoloOG" />

